  "description": "Yang Ah-young is a struggling, unknown model barely making ends meet. With the help of fashion editor Ha Sun-woo, he lands the chance to appear in a prestigious magazine—but along with that opportunity comes a face he never wanted to see again for the rest of his life.\n\n*“These photos aren’t turning out well at all, Ah-young.”*  \n*“Then I’ll show you… the photos that suit you best.”*\n\nMeeting Kwon Tae-won again—  \n...that was a devastating mistake.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000060537), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/playback)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://honto.jp/ebook/pd-series_C-MBJ-21782-8-607138X.html)",
